# Other agents' integrations (added by bd init; not used here)
.codex/
.cursor/
.agents/

# Local preview build (never committed). The leading slash matters: without it this pattern
# matches a directory named preview at ANY depth, and it was quietly hiding the SOURCE of the
# 2026-11-19 design preview as well as its output: cloudflare/src/preview/ (the stylesheets,
# the two webfonts and their licences) and cloudflare/scripts/preview/ (the saved copy of the
# Rules Sheet page). Only the built output at the repository root is meant to be ignored.
/preview/
